--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Driftband reimplements the *concept* of the "smoke graph" - popularised by
SmokePing (Tobias Oetiker, GPL-2.0-or-later). No SmokePing source code is used,
copied, or derived from. Only the visual idea (median line + loss-coloured
segments + shaded percentile bands) is reimplemented from scratch in an
independent stack. Credit to SmokePing and Tobias Oetiker as inspiration.

Third-party components keep their own licenses: see THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md
and licenses/ in the source tree, or /usr/share/licenses/driftband/ in the
container image.
